	(text "J2: harness to the pack sense board 2x10, same pin map.\nColumns 4-10 zigzag B0..B13: a bent pin shorts 1 cell\nacross a column, 2 cells along a row.\nNTC return = B0 at the pack sense board. Spare: pin 12.\nB0 lands on BAT- (datasheet p70: VC0 tied to VSS on PCB)."
