	(text "Four thermistors: TS1, TS3, CFETOFF (NTC1-3), HDQ (board).\nTS2 stays free as SHUTDOWN wake (p22 pin table, section 13):\nswitch to VSS through 10k (Fig 16-2 R27). 1nF: p65 limit <4nF.\nREGIN, BREG tied to VSS, REG1, REG2 open (p75): I2C pull-ups on LP.\nCFETOFF as NTC needs DFETOFF set as BOTHOFF to stop CHG by pin (p48)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b72bfee-7a72-5ee4-b9e9-80818f6ab016")
	)
	(text "SIZING (design/README 2.2, shunt 0.25 mOhm; datasheet p22 steps)\nOCD1 16 mV = 64 A (hardware comparator, up to 425 ms)    OCD3 60 A for 1 s (current-based, inside the AFE, the agreed 60 A ceiling)\nOCC 12 mV = 48 A at 425 ms    SCD 40 mV = 160 A, +/-15% = 136-184 A, delay 15-450 us in 15 us steps\nOCD and OCC are set in 2 mV steps. Accuracy below 20 mV is -2/+2.65 mV (p22), about -8/+10.6 A on this shunt."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "047c5a2f-b028-523c-9927-0f334d6c49b3")
	)
	(text "OPEN ON THIS SHEET\n1. PACK_PRESENT_N: loop pulled low through BAT- when J2 is mated. PLAN says it opens DSG directly; the logic joining it to DFETOFF is not captured here.\n2. External balance FETs (PLAN 3.1, 150 mA per cell) are not captured. They change the cell RC network: revisit 20R.\n3. CP1 raised to 1 uF for the 4+4 FET gate load (p65 rule): worst case 1.69 uC droops 11 V by 1.7 V, pump start about 130 ms.\n4. I2C pull-ups, ALERT pull-up and the DFETOFF/CFETOFF polarity go with the LP sheets and OTP settings.\n5. No footprints yet for J1, J3 (M4 terminal part not chosen) or RS1 (no 3921 4-terminal in the library). J2 footprint assumes Micro-Fit vertical."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a4a21d95-a899-5630-b77d-08f5e5facd2b")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
